{"seq":1,"slug":"exception-trend-rootcause","title":"差异趋势与根因分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/exception-governance/exception-trend-rootcause","wordCount":2274,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"差异趋势与根因分析\">差异趋势与根因分析</h1><p>一个团队月处理三千张工单和处理一千张工单，工作量差三倍，但这是否说明第一个团队更差？不一定——可能它的交易量也是三倍。衡量例外处理健康度的从来不是绝对数量，而是<strong>比率</strong>：每万笔交易的例外数、例外中自动消化的比例、进入人工后按时结论的比例。只有把这些比率按时间序列和维度切片，才能回答治理的第一组问题：这一期比上一期是好转还是恶化，恶化的部分集中在哪。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-指标的分母与归因层级\">核心概念：指标的分母与归因层级</h2><p>趋势分析最容易犯的错误是用错分母。&quot;本期工单数上升 20%&quot;这句话没有信息量，除非分母明确。跨境对账里有三个候选分母，各自回答不同问题：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;例外指标&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;分母1:交易笔数&lt;br/&gt;例外率 = 例外数 / 交易数&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; C[&quot;分母2:对账批次记录数&lt;br/&gt;不平率 = 不平记录 / 总记录&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; D[&quot;分母3:上期同类值&lt;br/&gt;环比 = 本期 / 上期&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E[&quot;渠道维度切片&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;归因层级 1:渠道&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;归因层级 2:差异类型&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;归因层级 3:机制&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt; I[&quot;可执行整改项&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"例外指标\"] --&gt; B[\"分母1:交易笔数&lt;br/&gt;例外率 = 例外数 / 交易数\"]\n  A --&gt; C[\"分母2:对账批次记录数&lt;br/&gt;不平率 = 不平记录 / 总记录\"]\n  A --&gt; D[\"分母3:上期同类值&lt;br/&gt;环比 = 本期 / 上期\"]\n  B --&gt; E[\"渠道维度切片\"]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[\"归因层级 1:渠道\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"归因层级 2:差异类型\"]\n  G --&gt; H[\"归因层级 3:机制\"]\n  H --&gt; I[\"可执行整改项\"]</pre><p>归因要逐层下钻，不能从&quot;例外率上升&quot;直接跳到&quot;加强管理&quot;。三层下钻之后，整改项才是可执行的：不是&quot;关注 A 渠道&quot;，而是&quot;在 A 渠道的 USD 手续费差异上把费率表同步周期从月度改为周度&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指标定义与基线\">指标定义与基线</h2><h3 id=\"四个核心比率的精确定义\">四个核心比率的精确定义</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>期望方向</th>\n<th>常见误用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自动匹配率</td>\n<td>无需人工即对平的记录 / 总记录</td>\n<td>升</td>\n<td>把&quot;自动关单&quot;也算进去，导致口径不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>例外率</td>\n<td>产生例外记录 / 总记录</td>\n<td>降</td>\n<td>用交易笔数做分母跨渠道比较（渠道笔均金额差异大）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自动消化率</td>\n<td>容差/自愈消化 / 例外总数</td>\n<td>升</td>\n<td>不区分容差核销与在途自愈，两个含义完全不同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一次做对率</td>\n<td>未经重开/升级即关闭的工单 / 关闭工单数</td>\n<td>升</td>\n<td>分母用全部工单而非关闭工单，把在办工单算成失败</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一个指标的设计值得展开。<strong>一次做对率（first-pass yield）</strong> 是本周最诚实的质量指标：它同时惩罚&quot;结论被推翻&quot;和&quot;必须升级才能解决&quot;，而这两者恰好对应流程缺陷与技能缺口两类不同的问题。但它必须区分&quot;重开&quot;的两种原因——因渠道回函而重开（我们无法预知）与因内控抽检发现理由不成立而重开（我们可以避免），只有后者应计入扣分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基线的建立\">基线的建立</h3><p>没有基线的趋势是噪声。基线有两种建立方式，应当同时使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>时间基线</strong>：同渠道过去 8–13 周的移动中位数，用于检测突变。用中位数而非均值，避免大促期把基线抬高后掩盖后续恶化。</li>\n<li><strong>横截面基线</strong>：同类渠道（同为卡组织、同等交易规模）的当期中位数，用于发现&quot;某渠道显著偏离同类&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>异常分数</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mtext>median</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>13..</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1.4826</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>MAD</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>13..</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{异常分数} = \\frac{x_t - \\text{median}(x_{t-13..t-1})}{1.4826 \\cdot \\text{MAD}(x_{t-13..t-1})}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">异常分数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1.4826</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MAD</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">13..</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">median</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">13..</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>用中位数绝对偏差（MAD）而不是标准差，是因为差异率序列本身带离群值（大促、渠道故障），标准差会被这些点放大而让检测变得迟钝。系数 1.4826 让 MAD 在正态假设下与标准差同尺度，这是稳健统计的通行做法。</p>\n<p>同类思想在 SRE 领域有成熟的对应物：用多窗口与相对消耗速率而不是绝对阈值来判定&quot;是否异常&quot;，Google SRE 工作簿推荐的 multiwindow multi-burn-rate 告警正是把&quot;相对基线的消耗速率&quot;作为判据，并用长短两个窗口同时确认&quot;已经发生&quot;与&quot;仍在发生&quot;（<a href=\"https://sre.google/workbook/alerting-on-slos/\">Alerting on SLOs</a>）。对账例外率检测可以借用这个双窗口结构：长窗口确认趋势已形成，短窗口确认恶化仍在继续，从而避免在一次性波动上生成整改项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归因下钻的工程实现\">归因下钻的工程实现</h2><h3 id=\"从比率变化到具体机制\">从比率变化到具体机制</h3><p>归因的本质是把&quot;总量变化&quot;分解到各维度贡献。以渠道维度为例，总例外率的变化可以分解为各渠道的贡献之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta R = \\sum_c \\left( \\frac{E_{c,t}}{V_{c,t}}\\cdot w_{c,t} - \\frac{E_{c,t-1}}{V_{c,t-1}}\\cdot w_{c,t-1} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span> 是例外数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是交易数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 是该渠道的交易占比。这样分解后能立刻区分两种完全不同的情况：某渠道自身例外率恶化（第一项变大），还是交易结构变化导致高例外渠道占比上升（第二项变大）——<strong>前者要治理渠道，后者要调整业务结构</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH cur AS (&#10;  SELECT channel_code, diff_type,&#10;         count(*) FILTER (WHERE created_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;7 days&#39;) AS cur_exc,&#10;         count(*) FILTER (WHERE created_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;14 days&#39;&#10;                            AND created_at &lt;  now() - interval &#39;7 days&#39;) AS prv_exc&#10;  FROM recon_exception&#10;  WHERE created_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;14 days&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY 1,2&#10;)&#10;SELECT channel_code, diff_type, prv_exc, cur_exc,&#10;       cur_exc - prv_exc AS delta,&#10;       round(100.0 * (cur_exc - prv_exc) / greatest(prv_exc, 1), 1) AS delta_pct&#10;FROM cur&#10;WHERE abs(cur_exc - prv_exc) &gt;= 5&#10;ORDER BY abs(cur_exc - prv_exc) DESC&#10;LIMIT 30;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cur </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel_code, diff_type,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7 days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cur_exc,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'14 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                            AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7 days'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prv_exc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> recon_exception</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'14 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> channel_code, diff_type, prv_exc, cur_exc,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       cur_exc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prv_exc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delta,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (cur_exc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prv_exc) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> greatest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(prv_exc, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delta_pct</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cur</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cur_exc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prv_exc) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cur_exc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prv_exc) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>门槛 <code>abs(delta) &gt;= 5</code> 不是任意的：笔数太少时百分比变化毫无意义（从 1 笔变 3 笔是&quot;增长 200%&quot;）。设绝对门槛比设百分比门槛更稳健。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三类典型机制及其识别信号\">三类典型机制及其识别信号</h3><p>下钻到机制层需要把统计信号与业务知识对应起来。以下是跨境对账里最常见的三类，每类都有明确的识别特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>信号特征</th>\n<th>快速验证方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>费率版本不同步</td>\n<td>某渠道某天起差异率阶跃上升，且差异额与交易额成固定比例</td>\n<td>核对渠道费率变更公告的生效日</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清算时点漂移</td>\n<td>在途类差异的观察窗到期率上升，但真差异率不变</td>\n<td>比较该渠道观察窗耗时的分位数是否右移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件字段截断</td>\n<td>匹配率下降而非例外率上升，参考号匹配失败集中在长单号</td>\n<td>抽样比对归一化前后的参考号长度分布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二类的识别尤其值得说明：清算时点漂移<strong>不会</strong>让例外率上升多少，因为大部分在途差异会被观察窗消化掉；它的信号是观察窗内的停留时间变长。如果只看例外率，这个机制会被完全漏掉，直到某天窗口设置得太短导致批量误判。</p>\n<p>这与 <a href=\"../exception-classify-match/long-short-transit-fee-fx\">长款/短款/在途/手续费/汇率差异</a> 中&quot;观察窗按渠道用 99 分位标定&quot;的做法直接衔接：当分位数右移时，窗口需要重新标定，否则原来的窗口会开始漏放真差异。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从分析到整改项\">从分析到整改项</h2><h3 id=\"整改项的字段设计\">整改项的字段设计</h3><p>分析产出必须是<strong>可跟踪的整改项</strong>，而不是一份报告。整改项的数据结构决定了它能不能被闭环。这里可以借用事件溯源（event sourcing）的思路：状态变化被记录为不可变事件序列，任意时刻状态可重放重建，完整历史本身即可靠审计日志（<a href=\"https://microservices.io/patterns/data/event-sourcing.html\">Event sourcing</a>）。整改项从 <code>open</code> 到 <code>verified</code> 的每一次状态迁移都落一条事件，而不是覆盖一个字段——这样&quot;这个假设什么时候被否掉的&quot;永远可查。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;finding_id&quot;: &quot;RF-2026-09-014&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scope&quot;: { &quot;channel_code&quot;: &quot;CH_CARD_ACQ&quot;, &quot;diff_type&quot;: &quot;fee_diff&quot;, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;USD&quot; },&#10;  &quot;evidence&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;exception_rate&quot;,&#10;    &quot;baseline_median&quot;: 0.0031,&#10;    &quot;current&quot;: 0.0087,&#10;    &quot;anomaly_score&quot;: 6.4,&#10;    &quot;since&quot;: &quot;2026-09-18&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;hypothesis&quot;: &quot;rate_card_version_stale&quot;,&#10;  &quot;owner&quot;: &quot;channel-ops&quot;,&#10;  &quot;action&quot;: &quot;sync_rate_card_weekly&quot;,&#10;  &quot;target&quot;: { &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;exception_rate&quot;, &quot;value&quot;: 0.0035, &quot;by&quot;: &quot;2026-10-15&quot; },&#10;  &quot;linked_cases&quot;: [&quot;CS-2026-09-004312&quot;, &quot;CS-2026-09-004401&quot;],&#10;  &quot;state&quot;: &quot;open&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"finding_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"RF-2026-09-014\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"channel_code\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CH_CARD_ACQ\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"diff_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fee_diff\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"USD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"exception_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"baseline_median\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0031</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"current\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0087</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"anomaly_score\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"since\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-18\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"hypothesis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rate_card_version_stale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"channel-ops\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sync_rate_card_weekly\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"exception_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0035</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-10-15\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"linked_cases\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CS-2026-09-004312\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CS-2026-09-004401\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"state\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"open\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>hypothesis</code> 与 <code>action</code> 分开是关键：同一个信号可能对应多个假设（费率过期 vs 某类交易被新增加收附加费），先记录假设，验证后再定行动。如果直接跳到行动，分析就退化成猜测。</p>\n<h3 id=\"验证整改是否有效\">验证整改是否有效</h3><p>整改项关闭不能靠&quot;时间到了&quot;，而要靠<strong>指标回到目标区间并保持</strong>。验证窗口至少两个完整对账周期，因为单个周期的波动可能大于整改效果：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>验证阶段</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>未达成时的动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>T+1 周期</td>\n<td>指标方向正确（下降）</td>\n<td>继续观察，不改结论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T+2 周期</td>\n<td>指标进入目标区间</td>\n<td>关闭整改项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T+2 周期</td>\n<td>无改善</td>\n<td>假设错误，重新归因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>T+4 周期</td>\n<td>再次恶化</td>\n<td>升级为 <a href=\"high-risk-channel-govern\">高发渠道治理</a> 专项</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;T+1 只要求方向正确&quot;这一条很重要。如果 T+1 就要求达标，会逼着团队选择见效快但不治本的整改（比如临时放宽容差），把问题推到下个季度。这与 <a href=\"../exception-classify-match/exception-rule-threshold\">例外规则与容差阈值</a> 中&quot;翻案率是容差是否过宽的唯一可靠信号&quot;是同一套约束的两个侧面：放宽容差能让指标立刻好看，但翻案率会随后上升并把它揭穿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>趋势分析必须明确分母；例外率、自动消化率、一次做对率的定义要精确，特别注意区分&quot;容差核销&quot;与&quot;在途自愈&quot;。</li>\n<li>基线用移动中位数 + MAD 的稳健异常分数，而不是均值 ± 标准差，避免大促期抬高基线掩盖后续恶化。</li>\n<li>归因分解为&quot;渠道自身恶化&quot;与&quot;结构变化&quot;两部分，两者的整改动作完全不同。</li>\n<li>三类典型机制各有识别信号，其中清算时点漂移只体现在观察窗耗时分位数右移，不会显著推高例外率。</li>\n<li>整改项要分开 <code>hypothesis</code> 与 <code>action</code>，验证要求&quot;回到目标并保持两个周期&quot;，T+1 只看方向——否则会激励治标不治本。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>归因指向具体渠道之后，需要建立专项治理——见 <a href=\"high-risk-channel-govern\">高发渠道治理</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"差异趋势与根因分析","id":"差异趋势与根因分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：指标的分母与归因层级","id":"核心概念-指标的分母与归因层级"},{"level":2,"text":"指标定义与基线","id":"指标定义与基线"},{"level":3,"text":"四个核心比率的精确定义","id":"四个核心比率的精确定义"},{"level":3,"text":"基线的建立","id":"基线的建立"},{"level":2,"text":"归因下钻的工程实现","id":"归因下钻的工程实现"},{"level":3,"text":"从比率变化到具体机制","id":"从比率变化到具体机制"},{"level":3,"text":"三类典型机制及其识别信号","id":"三类典型机制及其识别信号"},{"level":2,"text":"从分析到整改项","id":"从分析到整改项"},{"level":3,"text":"整改项的字段设计","id":"整改项的字段设计"},{"level":3,"text":"验证整改是否有效","id":"验证整改是否有效"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"账龄分析与积压清理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/suspense-writeoff/aging-exception-cleanup"},"next":{"title":"高发渠道治理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/reconciliation-exception-case-platform/exception-governance/high-risk-channel-govern"}}